! ((BPFK)) Sections

See ((baupla fuzykamni)) and ((BPFK Procedures)).

Don't be afraid to improve a page if it's red! See ((BPFK Community Work)) for more information.

~~#FF0033:Red lines have no assigned member.~~
~~#00AA00:Green lines have been checkpointed at least once, and hence are expected to not suck too badly.~~
~~#0000FF: Blue lines have been improved up to the standards of ((BPFK Community Work)).~~

There are sections, which are very granular, super-sections, which are less so, and super-super-sections, which are huge.

The idea is that in some cases proposals will cover a broad area of the language.

Please note that the sections are not actually named, for example, "Morphology".  They are actually named "BPFK Section: Morphology".

